=== Q1 STAGE 0: IBP algebra identity (local densities) ===
PROPERTY_USED: O(G+,G-) -> 0 as w -> +/- oo (compact/decaying window support)
before_ibp_2 - ibp_2 - d/dw(Omega*delta_j_w) = 0
before_ibp_1 - ibp_1 - d/dw(Omega*delta_j_w_face) = 0
ibp_identity_holds_choice2: True
ibp_identity_holds_choice1: True

=== Q1 STAGE 1: first-shape-order integrands (after IBP, boundary dropped) ===
