DIFF_IDENTICALLY_ZERO: False
DIFF_VANISHES_IFF_CURRENT_W_INDEPENDENT_EQUAL_FACE: True
CONCRETE_LINEAR_IN_W_CURRENT_INTEGRAL_DIFF_ZERO: False
SURVIVING_STRUCTURED_FORM:
  Integral[ (dOmega/deps|_0)*(div_x delta_j(w) - div_x delta_j_face)
           - (d/deps dOmega/dw|_0)*(delta_j_w(w) - delta_j_w_face) , {w,-oo,oo} ]
EQUIVALENT_AFTER_SECOND_IBP_AND_DECAY (second_ibp_identity_holds=True):
  Integral[ (dOmega/deps|_0)*(div_4 delta_j(w) - div_x delta_j_face) , {w,-oo,oo} ]
DEPENDS_ON: window shape variation (dh+/-, through dOm0), and w-variation of delta_j
            relative to its background-face value; density sector cancels in the diff.
BOUNDARY_PROPERTY_USED: Omega -> 0 and (dOmega/deps)|_0 -> 0 as w -> +/- oo
  (drops [Omega*j_w] and [dOm0*(j_w - j_w_face)]).
BOUNDARY_CHECK: Stage0 IBP residual = 0 ; Stage3 second-IBP residual after doit = 0
